{"id":"894d98ef1d9353b3ef45bd3340272bfddeb59f26","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/56791","title":"翁荔刚回OpenAI，Thinking Machines反手甩出新模型 - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"新智元\n                  2026-08-01 13:10 分享","excerpt":"Thinking Machines公司发布第二款AI模型Inkling-Small，总参数276B、激活参数12B，支持原生多模态与100万token超长上下文。其体量仅为此前975B Inkling的四分之一，却在ARC-AGI-2等基准测试中实现对更大模型的性能反超，引发业界关注。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"js_content\"><h3 data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" data-style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(117, 114, 114);white-space: normal;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"246\" data-backw=\"578\" data-imgfileid=\"505231957\" data-ratio=\"0.42643923240938164\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/987dfc155d8319259a7b9f6c78c182ab1785561008208.webp\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"2345\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/987dfc155d8319259a7b9f6c78c182ab1785561008208.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section></h3><h3><section data-id=\"88402\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\"><p><span><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">&#160;&#160;</span></span></strong><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">新智元报道 &#160;</span></span></strong></span></p></section></h3><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">首个模型Inkling亮相之后，全新AI又刷屏了！</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">今天，Thinking Machines正式发布第二款重磅模型——Inkling-Small。</span></span></p><section><p><span leaf=\"\">276B总参数、12B激活参数，原生多模态，100万token上下文</span></p></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"287\" data-backw=\"562\" data-height=\"646\" data-imgfileid=\"505231943\" data-ratio=\"0.5102685624012638\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4c8c41bac0a092bb9670f22ae61ca42c1785561008208.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1266\" data-width=\"1266\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4c8c41bac0a092bb9670f22ae61ca42c1785561008208.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">半个月前，首个开源975B Inkling登场，曾在AI圈掀起了巨浪。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Inkling-Small仅用四分之一体量，直接实现了对「万亿大哥」的性能反超。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"138\" data-backw=\"562\" data-height=\"288\" data-imgfileid=\"505231944\" data-ratio=\"0.2453151618398637\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/04a429413ad965070b666b675fabbb771785561008208.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1174\" data-width=\"1174\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/04a429413ad965070b666b675fabbb771785561008208.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"282\" data-backw=\"562\" data-height=\"564\" data-imgfileid=\"505231947\" data-ratio=\"0.5022261798753339\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e985f34c78a9328f9d0b90fed9bc30711785561008208.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1123\" data-width=\"1123\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e985f34c78a9328f9d0b90fed9bc30711785561008208.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"ms8ai6m5133v\" data-mpa-action-id=\"ms8ai6mbg4j\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span textstyle=\"\">在ARC-AGI-2上，Inkling-Small刷新开源SOTA</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">回看Thinking Machines这几天，剧情堪称跌宕起伏。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">联创翁荔官宣离职仅两天，OpenAI便证实了她的回归——带队攻坚「递归自我提升」（RSI）。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"316\" data-backw=\"562\" data-height=\"388\" data-imgfileid=\"505231946\" data-ratio=\"0.5623188405797102\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/afa18dfb6b8d9a22497aba817b55452b1785561008208.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"690\" data-width=\"690\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/afa18dfb6b8d9a22497aba817b55452b1785561008208.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">结果就在第三天，这家刚少了一位核心大将的公司，直接把新模型的「全量权重」甩了出来。</span></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001785561008208.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001785561008208.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">全新Inkling-Small登场</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">276B击败万亿</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">官博介绍中，Inkling-Small是一个MoE架构的模型，总参数2760亿，单次推理激活120亿。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">相较于初代Inkling，体量直接浓缩成四分之一。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">正如Pytorch大神Horace He所言，「Inkling-Small根本不用举全村之力，直接沿用前代技术就成了」。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">最硬核的是，体量虽缩小了，综合实力显著提升。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"158\" data-backw=\"562\" data-height=\"332\" data-imgfileid=\"505231945\" data-ratio=\"0.28040540540540543\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c0f644757d0e27ec19c1cd9c7e797e871785561008209.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1184\" data-width=\"1184\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c0f644757d0e27ec19c1cd9c7e797e871785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">在数学、推理、智能体编码、多模态基准中，Inkling-Small堪比，甚至超越了Inkling、DeepSeek V4 Flash。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"533\" data-backw=\"562\" data-height=\"1254\" data-imgfileid=\"505231952\" data-ratio=\"0.9485627836611196\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/70e0357957b3ca35bde2e97a5a66ace51785561008209.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1322\" data-width=\"1322\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/70e0357957b3ca35bde2e97a5a66ace51785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">在HLE、Terminal-Bench、IFBench这三个核心指标上——Inkling-Small每一FLOP换来的性能都高于Inkling。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">可以看到，Inkling-Small的曲线，全程压在Inkling上面。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/86fae0f47f3de128e037092422c7e5bb1785561008209.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.41523809523809524\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2100\" data-width=\"2100\" data-height=\"872\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"233\" data-imgfileid=\"505231950\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/86fae0f47f3de128e037092422c7e5bb1785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9b29871bfba0f583e510f17f270161431785561008209.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.4157088122605364\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2088\" data-width=\"2088\" data-height=\"868\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"234\" data-imgfileid=\"505231951\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9b29871bfba0f583e510f17f270161431785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">多模态那边也几乎没掉队没，图表理解、视觉推理、语音理解、长音频推理，Inkling-Small在评测中「接近」原版，代价却低得多。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">其他基准测试成绩如下：</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3863376fc86cc03552b5374e82d9b1d81785561008209.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.7303240740740741\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1728\" data-width=\"1728\" data-height=\"1262\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"410\" data-imgfileid=\"505231948\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3863376fc86cc03552b5374e82d9b1d81785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">一个体积只有四分之一的模型，在推理和智能体任务上把它的老大哥按在了地上。</span></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001785561008209.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">后训练细节，全公开了</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">至于如何做到，官方把方法写得很细，关键是两步。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7b46c0513e52ce99994d5e9924f40e371785561008209.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6598173515981736\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1752\" data-width=\"1752\" data-height=\"1156\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"371\" data-imgfileid=\"505231949\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7b46c0513e52ce99994d5e9924f40e371785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Inkling-Small 的训练开始时间晚于 Inkling，于是把前一轮踩过的坑全部吃进去了——</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">预训练数据配比改了，机器学习配方重新精炼过。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">更关键的，是两步操作。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">第一步，用 Inkling 当老师做 on-policy 蒸馏，先出一个 preview 检查点。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">第二步，从这个检查点接着跑了整整两周的智能体编码强化学习。于是就有了「学生超过老师」的结果。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">仅用两周的时间，就把差距拉了回来，还反超了。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这意味着，Thinking Machines直接跑通了一条能反复出模型的产线。第一个模型是作品，第二个模型是产能证明。</span></span></p><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1785561008209.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">120亿激活，才是真正的分水岭</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">对绝大多开发者来说，真正关心的是，自己能不能用起来？</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">原版Inkling门槛非常高，BF16检查点最低要求是2TB聚合显存——</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">示例配置是，8张B300或16张H200；就算换成NVFP4量化版，也还要600GB起步。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5ae5f5b1b576d74e1c8cb4b02a3088ab1785561008209.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"960\" data-width=\"960\" data-height=\"540\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505231955\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5ae5f5b1b576d74e1c8cb4b02a3088ab1785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Inkling-Small把这道门槛，整个往下拽了一大截。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">LMSYS的说法很直接：276B总参数配12B激活，是强化学习的甜点位，LoRA和全参数训练都变得「够得着」。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">以前只有大厂能玩的模型定制，现在一个中等规模的团队，也有机会真的把它训成自己的东西。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">实测显示，8张B200、TP8、NVFP4、batch size 1的同一套环境下，用SGLang跑Inkling-Small，开DSpark能到648 tok/s解码，不开也有288 tok/s。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7a6d17298fc7c9a6b1eed768321191b01785561008209.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505231953\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7a6d17298fc7c9a6b1eed768321191b01785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001785561008209.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">六个联创走了四个</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">模型越发越快</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">去年2月，Thinking Machines带着一份「OpenAI梦之队」的六人名单惊艳开局：</span></span></p><section><p><span leaf=\"\">Mira Murati、John Schulman、Barret Zoph、翁荔、Andrew Tulloch、Luke Metz。</span></p></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">当时，他们拿的是20亿美元种子轮、120亿美元估值的逆天剧本。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">谁能想到，今年1月那轮500亿美元估值的融资最终流产，成为了转折的开始。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">如今，六人团只剩下了Murati和Schulman。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">更有意思的是，离开的四个人里，Zoph和Metz先后回了OpenAI，如今翁荔成为了第三个。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">一家由OpenAI「叛逆者」组建的公司，核心骨干最终还是没能逃脱OpenAI的引力场。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-mpa-action-id=\"ms8aks0t4d7\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e981c3a8a984a1f1e4b8ebfc409aa1371785561008209.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.4800514800514801\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"777\" data-width=\"777\" data-height=\"1150\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"832\" data-imgfileid=\"505231954\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e981c3a8a984a1f1e4b8ebfc409aa1371785561008209.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">但真正充满戏剧性的，是团队在面临动荡时的反应。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">7月15日，沉默了整整17个月的Thinking Machines终于交出了首个大模型Inkling。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">不到两周，翁荔宣布离职；仅仅三天后，第二个带着全量权重的开源模型又紧跟着上线。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">人才在加速流失，模型在加速狂飙。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这两条背道而驰的曲线，成了AI行业中最具代表性的一幕。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">也许这就是通向ASI的必经之路：不管留下的人有多么少，机器向前的车轮，只会越转越快。</span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">参考资料：</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">https://thinkingmachines.ai/news/inkling-small/</span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">编辑：桃子</span></span></p><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">秒追ASI</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">点赞、转发、在看一键三连</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1785561008210.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"122\" data-imgfileid=\"505133683\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1785561008210.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01785561008210.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6129629629629629\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"355\" data-imgfileid=\"505229036\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01785561008210.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section></div></DIV>","content_text":"新智元报道 首个模型Inkling亮相之后，全新AI又刷屏了！今天，Thinking Machines正式发布第二款重磅模型——Inkling-Small。276B总参数、12B激活参数，原生多模态，100万token上下文半个月前，首个开源975B Inkling登场，曾在AI圈掀起了巨浪。Inkling-Small仅用四分之一体量，直接实现了对「万亿大哥」的性能反超。在ARC-AGI-2上，Inkling-Small刷新开源SOTA回看Thinking Machines这几天，剧情堪称跌宕起伏。联创翁荔官宣离职仅两天，OpenAI便证实了她的回归——带队攻坚「递归自我提升」（RSI）。结果就在第三天，这家刚少了一位核心大将的公司，直接把新模型的「全量权重」甩了出来。全新Inkling-Small登场276B击败万亿官博介绍中，Inkling-Small是一个MoE架构的模型，总参数2760亿，单次推理激活120亿。相较于初代Inkling，体量直接浓缩成四分之一。正如Pytorch大神Horace He所言，「Inkling-Small根本不用举全村之力，直接沿用前代技术就成了」。最硬核的是，体量虽缩小了，综合实力显著提升。在数学、推理、智能体编码、多模态基准中，Inkling-Small堪比，甚至超越了Inkling、DeepSeek V4 Flash。在HLE、Terminal-Bench、IFBench这三个核心指标上——Inkling-Small每一FLOP换来的性能都高于Inkling。可以看到，Inkling-Small的曲线，全程压在Inkling上面。多模态那边也几乎没掉队没，图表理解、视觉推理、语音理解、长音频推理，Inkling-Small在评测中「接近」原版，代价却低得多。其他基准测试成绩如下：一个体积只有四分之一的模型，在推理和智能体任务上把它的老大哥按在了地上。后训练细节，全公开了至于如何做到，官方把方法写得很细，关键是两步。Inkling-Small 的训练开始时间晚于 Inkling，于是把前一轮踩过的坑全部吃进去了——预训练数据配比改了，机器学习配方重新精炼过。更关键的，是两步操作。第一步，用 Inkling 当老师做 on-policy 蒸馏，先出一个 preview 检查点。第二步，从这个检查点接着跑了整整两周的智能体编码强化学习。于是就有了「学生超过老师」的结果。仅用两周的时间，就把差距拉了回来，还反超了。这意味着，Thinking Machines直接跑通了一条能反复出模型的产线。第一个模型是作品，第二个模型是产能证明。120亿激活，才是真正的分水岭对绝大多开发者来说，真正关心的是，自己能不能用起来？原版Inkling门槛非常高，BF16检查点最低要求是2TB聚合显存——示例配置是，8张B300或16张H200；就算换成NVFP4量化版，也还要600GB起步。Inkling-Small把这道门槛，整个往下拽了一大截。LMSYS的说法很直接：276B总参数配12B激活，是强化学习的甜点位，LoRA和全参数训练都变得「够得着」。以前只有大厂能玩的模型定制，现在一个中等规模的团队，也有机会真的把它训成自己的东西。实测显示，8张B200、TP8、NVFP4、batch size 1的同一套环境下，用SGLang跑Inkling-Small，开DSpark能到648 tok/s解码，不开也有288 tok/s。六个联创走了四个模型越发越快去年2月，Thinking Machines带着一份「OpenAI梦之队」的六人名单惊艳开局：Mira Murati、John Schulman、Barret Zoph、翁荔、Andrew Tulloch、Luke Metz。当时，他们拿的是20亿美元种子轮、120亿美元估值的逆天剧本。谁能想到，今年1月那轮500亿美元估值的融资最终流产，成为了转折的开始。如今，六人团只剩下了Murati和Schulman。更有意思的是，离开的四个人里，Zoph和Metz先后回了OpenAI，如今翁荔成为了第三个。一家由OpenAI「叛逆者」组建的公司，核心骨干最终还是没能逃脱OpenAI的引力场。但真正充满戏剧性的，是团队在面临动荡时的反应。7月15日，沉默了整整17个月的Thinking Machines终于交出了首个大模型Inkling。不到两周，翁荔宣布离职；仅仅三天后，第二个带着全量权重的开源模型又紧跟着上线。人才在加速流失，模型在加速狂飙。这两条背道而驰的曲线，成了AI行业中最具代表性的一幕。也许这就是通向ASI的必经之路：不管留下的人有多么少，机器向前的车轮，只会越转越快。参考资料：https://thinkingmachines.ai/news/inkling-small/编辑：桃子秒追ASI⭐点赞、转发、在看一键三连⭐点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！","fetched_at":"2026-08-02T05:08:31.517Z","ok":true}